  "releaseNotes": "- Many new *compare* validation attributes \n- New *predicate* validation attributes (`AndAttribute`, `OrAttribute`, `NotAttribute` and `IsValidAttribute`) to support complex validation rules through boolean predicates.\n- Drop support for *MS Ajax Validation*.\n- *jQuery* validation support for all the new validators, including the *predicate* ones.\n- Support for complex model-wise validation rules (using *predicate* validators and `IsValidAttribute`).",
